SUMMARY:6th Grade and New Student Information Session
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to welcome you and your incoming 6th grader or new 7th or 8th grader to SCS Leadership Academy for the 2025-26 school year! To help ease the transition and ensure you have all the information you need\, we would like to invite you to a quick informational meeting following the Meet and Greet Event on August 28th from 3:15 to 3:45 PM in the Humanities classroom. This is a great opportunity to learn more about this school year\, meet key staff members\, and ask any questions you may have as the school year begins. Students are welcome but not required to attend. Please reach out with any questions or concerns.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/6th-grade-and-new-student-information-session-2/
CATEGORIES:School Events
END:VEVENT
